{"version":1,"content":"<p>周星馳（星爺）電影《功夫女足》將推出粵語版，除了有星爺、蔡思貝配音外，當年曾客串《少林足球》的張栢芝，亦為《功》片擔任「星級配音員」，為片中女主角張小斐配音，身兼如此重任，連栢芝都笑言意想不到！</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;周</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T16:21:21.799503+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T16:01:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:18:12.867300+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T16:18:12.867300+00:00","content_hash":"7a57f6552b81a25707a7cdb0706175449618135d9a760458b8dacaa68e898634","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}